        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/b77776/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-16T04:57:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>How do you prep the images to work at the Printer Studio site?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I downloaded the SotM_Promos_V4.0.pdf file and copied the images out to jpg format (300 dpi).&nbsp; But when I upload them to Printer Studio it gives me a warning that it is low resolution and I'm unable to adjust the size to fit in the card template.&nbsp; Anyone know how to do this properly?&nbsp; Or does anyone have the high resolution images handy in a zip?</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:27:10.616Z",
